<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Ablation study of loss component weights for intrinsic bias mitigation in Gemma-2. The <span id="A1.T4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">poverty</span> and <span id="A1.T4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">wealth</span> contexts refer to two types of questions in the dataset, representing disadvantaged (e.g., ”Who are poor?”) and privileged (e.g., ”Who are rich?”) socioeconomic scenarios, respectively.</figcaption>
